<main class="store-policy"><header class="store-policy-hero"><span>UBHAYA FASHIONS · CUSTOMER CARE</span><h1>Return &amp; Refund <em>Policy</em></h1><p>Please review our final-sale policy and the process for reporting a product issue.</p></header><nav class="store-policy-nav"><a asp-action="Privacy">Privacy</a><a asp-action="Terms">Terms</a><a class="active" asp-action="Returns">Returns &amp; Refunds</a><a asp-action="Cancellation">Cancellation</a><a asp-controller="Shipping" asp-action="Index" class="active">Shipping</a></nav><div class="store-policy-content">
<div class="store-policy-notice"><strong>All sales are final.</strong><p>We do not accept returns or exchanges for change of mind, size selection, colour preference or personal preference.</p></div>
<section><h2>No returns or exchanges</h2><p>Please review product images, descriptions, size details and specifications carefully before placing an order. All purchases are final, except where a remedy is required under applicable law.</p></section>
<section><h2>Damaged, defective or incorrect items</h2><p>If your order arrives damaged, defective or different from what you ordered, contact us as soon as possible with your order number, a description and clear photographs or other available evidence. An unedited parcel-opening video can help our review, but contact us even if you do not have one.</p><p>We will review the concern and communicate any resolution available under applicable law and the circumstances of the order. Please keep the item and packaging until we respond, where practical.</p></section>
<section><h2>How to contact us</h2><p>Use our <a asp-controller="Contact" asp-action="Index">Contact Us</a> page or email <a href="mailto:ubhayafashions@gmail.com">ubhayafashions@gmail.com</a>. Include your order number and product details. Never send passwords, OTPs or full payment-card details.</p></section>
<section><h2>Refund processing</h2><p>Where a refund is approved or legally required, it will be initiated through the original payment method or another appropriate method communicated by our team. Bank and payment-provider processing times may vary.</p></section></div><p class="store-policy-date">Last updated: 31 October 2026</p></main>
